{"parents": [{"link": "../../", "title": "API Reference"}, {"link": "../", "title": "auth0_api_python"}], "prev": {"link": "../token_store/", "title": "auth0_api_python.token_store"}, "next": {"link": "../types/", "title": "auth0_api_python.types"}, "title": "auth0_api_python.token_utils", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth0_api_python.token_utils\">\n<span id=\"auth0-api-python-token-utils\"></span><h1>auth0_api_python.token_utils<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth0_api_python.token_utils\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"attributes\">\n<h2>Attributes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#attributes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.PRIVATE_JWK\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_utils.PRIVATE_JWK\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PRIVATE_JWK</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.PRIVATE_EC_JWK\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_utils.PRIVATE_EC_JWK\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PRIVATE_EC_JWK</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"functions\">\n<h2>Functions<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#functions\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_token\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_token\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">generate_token</span></code></a>(\u2192\u00a0str)</p></td>\n<td><p>Generates a real RS256-signed JWT using the private key above.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_dpop_proof\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_dpop_proof\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">generate_dpop_proof</span></code></a>(\u2192\u00a0str)</p></td>\n<td><p>Generates a real ES256-signed DPoP proof JWT using the EC private key above.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_token_with_cnf\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_token_with_cnf\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">generate_token_with_cnf</span></code></a>(\u2192\u00a0str)</p></td>\n<td><p>Generates an access token with cnf (confirmation) claim for DPoP binding.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_utils.PRIVATE_JWK\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.token_utils.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PRIVATE_JWK</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.PRIVATE_JWK\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_token\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.token_utils.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">generate_token</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">domain</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">user_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">audience</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">issuer</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">iat</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">exp</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">claims</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">expiration_time</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">3600</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_token\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Generates a real RS256-signed JWT using the private key above.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>domain</strong> \u2013 The Auth0 domain (used if issuer is not False).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>user_id</strong> \u2013 The \u2018sub\u2019 claim in the token.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>audience</strong> \u2013 The \u2018aud\u2019 claim in the token. If omitted, \u2018aud\u2019 won\u2019t be included.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>issuer</strong> \u2013 <ul>\n<li><p>If a string, it\u2019s placed in \u2018iss\u2019 claim.</p></li>\n<li><p>If None, default is f\u201d<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https:/\">https:/</a>/{domain}/\u201d.</p></li>\n<li><p>If False, skip \u2018iss\u2019 claim entirely.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>iat</strong> \u2013 Whether to set the \u2018iat\u2019 (issued at) claim. If False, skip it.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>exp</strong> \u2013 Whether to set the \u2018exp\u2019 claim. If False, skip it.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>claims</strong> \u2013 Additional custom claims to merge into the token.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>expiration_time</strong> \u2013 If exp is True, how many seconds from now until expiration.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>A RS256-signed JWT string.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt>Example usage:</dt><dd><dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>token = generate_token(</dt><dd><p>domain=\u201dexample.us.auth0.com\u201d,\nuser_id=\u201duser123\u201d,\naudience=\u201dmy-api\u201d,\nissuer=False,\niat=False,\nexp=False,\nclaims={\u201cscope\u201d: \u201cread:stuff\u201d}</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_utils.PRIVATE_EC_JWK\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.token_utils.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PRIVATE_EC_JWK</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.PRIVATE_EC_JWK\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_dpop_proof\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.token_utils.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">generate_dpop_proof</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">http_method</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">http_url</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jti</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">iat</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">claims</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">header_overrides</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">iat_time</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">include_jti</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">True</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_dpop_proof\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Generates a real ES256-signed DPoP proof JWT using the EC private key above.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 The access token to create proof for (used for ath claim).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>http_method</strong> \u2013 The HTTP method (e.g., \u201cGET\u201d, \u201cPOST\u201d) for htm claim.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>http_url</strong> \u2013 The HTTP URL for htu claim.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>jti</strong> \u2013 The unique identifier for the proof. If omitted, generates random UUID.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>iat</strong> \u2013 Whether to set the \u2018iat\u2019 (issued at) claim. If False, skip it.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>claims</strong> \u2013 Additional custom claims to merge into the proof.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>header_overrides</strong> \u2013 Override header parameters (e.g., for testing invalid headers).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>iat_time</strong> \u2013 Fixed time for iat claim (for testing). If None, uses current time.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>include_jti</strong> \u2013 Whether to include the \u2018jti\u2019 claim. If False, jti is completely omitted.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>An ES256-signed DPoP proof JWT string.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt>Example usage:</dt><dd><dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>proof = await generate_dpop_proof(</dt><dd><p>access_token=\u201deyJ\u2026\u201d,\nhttp_method=\u201dGET\u201d,\nhttp_url=\u201d<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://api.example.com/resource\">https://api.example.com/resource</a>\u201d,\niat=False,  # Skip iat for testing\nclaims={\u201ccustom\u201d: \u201cclaim\u201d}</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_token_with_cnf\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.token_utils.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">generate_token_with_cnf</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">domain</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">user_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">audience</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jkt_thumbprint</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_token_with_cnf\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Generates an access token with cnf (confirmation) claim for DPoP binding.\nExtends the existing generate_token() function with DPoP support.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>domain</strong> \u2013 The Auth0 domain (used if issuer is not False).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>user_id</strong> \u2013 The \u2018sub\u2019 claim in the token.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>audience</strong> \u2013 The \u2018aud\u2019 claim in the token.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>jkt_thumbprint</strong> \u2013 JWK thumbprint to include in cnf claim. If None, calculates from PRIVATE_EC_JWK.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>**kwargs</strong> \u2013 Additional arguments passed to generate_token().</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>A RS256-signed JWT string with cnf claim.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt>Example usage:</dt><dd><dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>token = await generate_token_with_cnf(</dt><dd><p>domain=\u201dauth0.local\u201d,\nuser_id=\u201duser123\u201d,\naudience=\u201dmy-api\u201d,\njkt_thumbprint=\u201dcustom_thumbprint\u201d</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["autoapi/auth0_api_python/types/index", "auth0_api_python.types", "N", "next"], ["autoapi/auth0_api_python/token_store/index", "auth0_api_python.token_store", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "autoapi/auth0_api_python/token_utils/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">auth0_api_python.token_utils</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#attributes\">Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#functions\">Functions</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.PRIVATE_JWK\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PRIVATE_JWK</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_token\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">generate_token()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.PRIVATE_EC_JWK\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PRIVATE_EC_JWK</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_dpop_proof\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">generate_dpop_proof()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_utils.generate_token_with_cnf\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">generate_token_with_cnf()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "autoapi/auth0_api_python/token_utils/index", "sidebars": ["about.html", "searchfield.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0]}